<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50153" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱζάνω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵζω</span>):
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b> causal, <i>make to sit</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵζανεν εὐρὺν ἀγῶνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					23.258
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>sit</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῷ [κλισίῳ] . . ἵζανον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					24.209
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Sapph.
				2.3
			</span></i>; <i>settle</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔ μοι ἐπ᾽ ὄμμασι νήδυμος ὕπνος
					ἱζάνει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					10.92
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ δρόσος ἱ. ἐπὶ δόνακας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Her.</u>
					19.19
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of soil,
				<i>settle down, subside</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τὸ κενούμενον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.76
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
